            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_n46ahE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We have an array of anti-slip, barricade, and glow-in-the-dark tapes to choose from, and we have the expertise to help you find the one that’s best for you. We specialize in <a href=\"/pages/custom-printed-tapes-labels\" title=\"Custom Printed Tapes & Labels\">customized solutions</a>, so if you don’t see exactly what you’re looking for, let us know! If you can imagine it, NADCO will make it stick. It’s what we’ve been doing for decades.</p><p>Our commitment is to our customers. We offer superior capabilities, short lead times, and consistent high-quality products and attentive service, and we see ourselves as your partner. It’s our mission to help you find or design the right safety tape solutions. <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a> to learn more about our wide selection of adhesive tapes and labels.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
